<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-AA-</p>
<p>Osaka Gas Co Ltd, $400 million unsecured due 2007.</p>
<p>-A-</p>
<p>Tokyo Electric Power Co Inc, $1 billion mortgaged due 2007.  </p>
<p>-BB-</p>
<p>Diamond Computer Service Co Ltd, five billion yen unsecured convertible due 2001, private placement.</p>
<p>Shin Nikkei Co Ltd, 10 billion yen unsecured due 2003.</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2004.</p>
</text>
